## Incremental Verification

**After each task (not just at the end)**:

### TypeScript Check (Modified Files Only)
```bash
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit path/to/file1.ts path/to/file2.ts
# Or full typecheck if many files
pnpm run typecheck
```

### Lint Check (Modified Files Only)
```bash
pnpm exec eslint path/to/file1.ts path/to/file2.ts
# Or full lint
pnpm run lint
```

### Build Check (After All Tasks)
```bash
pnpm run build
```

---

## Post-Execution Checklist

**Before marking complete**:

### 1. Run All Verification Commands
```bash
pnpm run typecheck
pnpm run lint
pnpm run build
```

### 2. Verify Against Plan
- All plan steps completed
- All acceptance criteria met
- No TODOs or incomplete sections

### 3. Web Final Check
- Search: "[implemented feature] best practices 2026"
- Verify implementation matches current patterns

### 4. Git Commit
```bash
git add .
git commit -m "feat: [feature description]

- Implements [feature] following [pattern]
- Uses [library] v[version] APIs
- Verified against [source1], [source2]
- All checks pass: typecheck, lint, build"
```

